<p>Heya Kate!</p>
<p>Welcome to the site, happy to have you here! SCP-3008 is a real great SCP, and yeah, once you get started with the SCP Universe, you tend to go spiraling down a giant rabbit hole, lol. I hope you don't feel too overwhelmed by everything! If you do though, that's why folks like me are here to help you out, so don't hesitate to come forward with any questions if you need anything.</p>
<p>Regardless, there's no rush to contribute in any regard, so take your time exploring and finding what really calls to you here. Below I've provided a reading list to help get you started, but again, feel free to reach out if you have any questions. It sounds like you have a lot of great hobbies too - sounds like one day in the future they might inspire future creations!</p>
<p>No worries about the essay, thank you for sharing with us! Happy exploring!</p>
